  "body": "Part of #290 (design decisions D1-D10 in its research comment).\n\nAdd `general.kind` values `wire_edm` and `sinker_edm` to the machine model (`crates/post/src/machine`), its mirror and `assets/machines/AGENTS.md`. Unknown kinds still refuse.\n- **Wire:** U/V travel bands, lower and upper guide heights, maximum taper angle (degrees), supported wire diameters, an `edm.awt` flag and an optional Z.\n- **Sinker:** Z travel, orbit capability (the list of supported pattern kinds with the machine's word for each), maximum orbit radius, pickup/reference method and electrode holder limits.\n- Absent keys stay \"not stated\". Ship one wire and one sinker library file with the dialect and condition tables empty (D4/D5).\n\n**Done means:** both kinds parse and round-trip, a garbled key refuses the file by name, an unknown kind still refuses, and the checker reports absent EDM keys as not stated. Pinned by machine tests.",
